Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next on the news, the two parts of the Atraxia heart, the famous jewel, were stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Currently it is broken into two, but by combining them their value true value is realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were in separate custody but, \Nthey were stolen at almost the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Currently the police is looking for trails.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder where it's lover is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your acquintance isn't here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.35,0:00:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reiri Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call me Rei Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want this then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.69,0:00:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.67,0:01:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.81,0:01:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:15.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.51,0:02:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Woman are weird creatures.{I am getting tired of this...}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not the thing you are looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.{boobs}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could these be fake and you are hiding it inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not there either, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Woman have another hole that a man doesn't {...yeah I get it, will shoot this guy if I ever meet him}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:22.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You noticed, as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eros the 3rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:30.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is my defeat, so please be gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got you!
